The new system should use a continuous loop conceptually equivalent to:

Observe → Understand → Choose Goal → Plan → Execute → Evaluate Outcome → Adapt.

Immediate tactical reactions should be possible without unnecessarily restarting an entire strategic plan.

Longer-term goals should persist across multiple simulation steps.

The CPU must know what it is currently attempting to accomplish and why.

